# Objects that moved on purpose. Each line: <text in the V016 baseline> => <text in the EF database>.
# Applied as plain text replacements to every baseline statement before the comparison, so the
# moved objects are compared statement by statement instead of being allow-listed.

# ADR 0011 D2: the supplier tables (and their sequences, constraints, indexes, triggers, grants and
# every reference to them) move from catalog to procurement.
catalog.supplier => procurement.supplier

# STAGE_7_PLAN 3.2 (decision C1, PR 7h1): the brands move from the Platform's ref schema to Inventory's catalog schema,
# with their ids, sequence, constraints, grants and every foreign key and view that points at them.
ref.brand => catalog.brand
